  "content": {
    "visible_text": "Skip to Content About Schedule Youth Program FAQs Contact < back Muay Thai Coach Lindsay Competition Experience: Amateur fights: 3 Semi-Contact Matches (MDL/PKB): 7 Coaching Experience: 3+ years of Muay Thai coaching at CMA Strength and Conditioning Program Director Beginners Program Assistant Coach Born  and raised in Houston, Texas, Lindsay traded competitive soccer for a  career in freestyle skiing upon moving to Utah with her family. She  proudly represented the United States in international competition for  11 years before retiring from professional athletics and venturing into  dual careers in engineering and fitness instruction. After relocating to  San Francisco in 2022, Lindsay joined California Martial Athletics as a  student and quickly cultivated a passion for Muay Thai. She hopes to  continue growing as a student, fighter and coach while she develops a  strength and conditioning program that is both a good workout and  beneficial to your development as a Muay Thai practitioner. Available for Private Coaching Name First Name (required) Last Name (required) Phone Email (required) Message (required) Submit Schedule About Newsletter Pricing FAQ s hello@cmasf.com I ‍  ‍ (415) 359-9294 ‍   ‍ 1217 Polk,  San Francisco",
